# Playwright E2E

**E2E plan template:** `base-tests/templates/testcase.yaml` (author on tests hub) · **testId contract:** `spec.ui.testIds` → `base-docs/platform/toolchain/E2E-TESTIDS.md`

```bash
pnpm test:e2e          # .nuxt-e2e, port NUXT_E2E_PORT (3005)
pnpm test:e2e:ui
```

Specs: `tests/e2e/**/*.spec.ts`

## Selector

```ts
await page.getByTestId('auth-login-email-input').fill('...')
await expect(page.getByTestId('customers-page')).toBeVisible()
```

Fallback semantic: `getByRole('alert')`, `getByRole('heading')` — **không** `input#email`.

## Layout integrity (sau `goto`)

```ts
import { assertLayoutIntegrity } from './helpers/assertLayoutIntegrity'
await assertLayoutIntegrity(page, { skipOverlap: true })
```

Fail khi: `overflow` (tràn), `collapsed` (shell rỗng/co), `overlap` (chồng element).

## Mock session

`tests/e2e/helpers/session.ts` — `mockAuthenticatedSession(page)`, `mockAuthenticatedApi(page)`

## Thêm spec mới

1. Page đã có `data-testid` (xem `base-docs/platform/toolchain/E2E-TESTIDS.md`)
2. `assertLayoutIntegrity` trong smoke test
3. `getByTestId` cho mọi interaction
